# Data: dialogs, quests, items, weapons (written as "@key" in the data)
dialog.grisha.speaker = Grisha
dialog.grisha.first = Another one who survived the road along the highway? Sit by the fire, nobody will shoot you here. I am Grisha.
dialog.grisha.first.1 = What is there to do around here?
dialog.grisha.first.2 = Are you selling anything?
dialog.grisha.first.3 = Just warming up. Take care.
dialog.grisha.found = Well, you really brought it? Bandages too? Here, take some rounds for it, they will be more use to you than to me.
dialog.grisha.found.1 = Glad to help.
dialog.grisha.waiting = The hospital is in the town east of here. Top floor, the ward on the north side. Watch out for the bandits by the brickworks.
dialog.grisha.waiting.1 = On my way.
dialog.grisha.start = You again. What do you need?
dialog.grisha.start.1 = Got any work for me?
dialog.grisha.start.2 = What is new in the Zone?
dialog.grisha.start.3 = Show me what you are selling.
dialog.grisha.start.4 = Nothing, take care.
dialog.grisha.work = There would be work. Before the last storm I hid supplies in the hospital in town, top floor. Then bandits chased me out. Bring them to me and you will not regret it.
dialog.grisha.work.1 = Deal, I will go there.
dialog.grisha.work.2 = Not now.
dialog.grisha.news = The dogs keep north of the camp again and the bandits have settled by the brickworks. And when you hear the siren, do not play the hero, get under a roof.
dialog.grisha.news.1 = Thanks for the advice.
dialog.tolik.speaker = Tolik
dialog.tolik.start = Hm? Yeah, warm yourself up. Just do not talk much, I am listening to the radio.
dialog.tolik.start.1 = What is on the radio?
dialog.tolik.start.2 = Who is in charge here?
dialog.tolik.start.3 = I will leave you be.
dialog.tolik.radio = Static, and now and then someone reading numbers. A military beacon, they say. I listen to it because of the storms: when it starts squealing, I have about a minute before the sky turns red.
dialog.tolik.radio.1 = Because of the storms?
dialog.tolik.radio.2 = Interesting.
dialog.tolik.storm = A storm comes without warning, only the siren from the town. Whoever is outside gets burnt from the inside. A cellar, a house, a wagon, anything with a roof. The dogs feel it before we do.
dialog.tolik.storm.1 = I will remember that.
dialog.tolik.boss = Nobody. But if you want work, ask Grisha. He always needs something.
dialog.tolik.boss.1 = Thanks.
quest.camp_stash.title = Supplies from the hospital
quest.camp_stash.description = Before the storm, Grisha from the camp at the marshalling yard hid supplies in the hospital in town. Then bandits drove him away from them.
quest.camp_stash.find = Find Grisha's stash in the hospital (top floor, the ward on the north side)
quest.camp_stash.report = Bring the supplies to Grisha at the camp
