dialog.tolik.radio.3 = It sounds weak. Is something wrong with it?
dialog.tolik.job = The valves are dying. There is an old locomotive on the tracks behind the camp, with a train radio in the cab. Take the amplifier out of it and bring it to me. Without it I will not hear the beacon in time.
dialog.tolik.job.1 = Fine, I will take a look.
dialog.tolik.job.2 = Not now.
dialog.tolik.waiting = The locomotive is right behind the camp, by the tracks. Climb into the cab by the steps on the side.
dialog.tolik.waiting.1 = On my way.
dialog.tolik.fixed = Let me see... yes, that will do. Hear that? The beacon is clear again. When it starts to whine, I will warn the whole camp. Here, something for your trouble.
dialog.tolik.fixed.1 = Glad to help.
quest.tolik_radio.title = Tolik's radio
quest.tolik_radio.description = Tolik listens to a military beacon to hear about storms early. But his radio's amplifier is dying. There is a spare in the train radio of the old locomotive by the camp.
quest.tolik_radio.find = Take the amplifier out of the radio in the locomotive (cab, steps on the side)
quest.tolik_radio.report = Bring the amplifier to Tolik at the camp
quest.tolik_radio.found = You have the amplifier from the train radio
quest.camp_stash.found = You found Grisha's supplies
storm.radio_warning = Tolik's radio is whining: a storm is coming. Find a roof in time.
