level.overgrown_street.title = Mulberry Street: overgrown
quest.dead_city.title = Dead City
quest.dead_city.description = On a band that used to carry only static, someone keeps repeating: "The parcel is at the newsstand on Union Square, by the memorial." Whoever left it never came back for it.
quest.dead_city.square = Reach the memorial on Union Square in the centre of the city
quest.dead_city.square_done = The war memorial. The newsstand should be close by.
quest.dead_city.stash = Find the parcel by the newsstand on Union Square
quest.dead_city.found = You found the parcel: rounds, a medkit and money
quest.dead_city.start = Someone on the radio is talking about a parcel on Union Square downtown
level.zone_city.title = Dead City
level.zone_city.hint = The city has been growing over for decades. Enter it at the South Entrance and follow the avenues up to Union Square and its memorial.
level.overgrown_street.hint = The city has been empty for decades and the street is going back to nature. Walk north to the barricade at its end.
quest.eddie.title = Eddie
quest.eddie.description = The same words are written over and over on the walls of Mulberry Street: EDDIE WAS HERE. In the middle of the street a barrel fire is still burning, but nobody sits by it.
quest.eddie.start = A fire burns in the middle of the street. Someone was here not long ago.
quest.eddie.camp = Go to the fire in the middle of the street
quest.eddie.camp_done = A note lies on the crate: "Eddie went over the barricade in the north, to the house at the end of the street. Back before dark." The radio keeps playing.
quest.eddie.north = Find Eddie at the north barricade
quest.eddie.found = Eddie never made it over the barricade. The last entry in his PDA: "Behind the bus it is quiet. Too quiet."
